<title>JAPAN: Parker plans share split.</title>
<headline>Parker plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parker Corp said on Monday it planned a 1.05-for-1 share split in late June, for shareholders as of March 31.</p>
</text>
